                                <div class="faq_items--answer">
                                    <p>
                                        The primary experience is using the app as a GPS unit first
                                        to provide the easiest way to see the front/center/back
                                        yardage for every shot. What’s different is that this app is
                                        the one to use to help you improve your game. With the
                                        easiest way to get one touch score and golf data into the
                                        app you’ll be able to get insights into your game sent right
                                        to you when the round ends.
                                    </p>
